  "description": "We are proud and excited to present 48 Haddington Road, Dublin 4 — a newly and beautifully refurbished four-storey Georgian house. This exceptional property features stunning high ceilings and large sash windows that fill the space with natural light. The generous ceiling height and open layout create a wonderful sense of space throughout this stylish 1-bedroom apartment.\n\nThe apartment includes a modern, fully fitted kitchen complete with a large fridge/freezer, washing machine/dryer, and dishwasher. The bedroom and living area area is thoughtfully arranged to maximize comfort and functionality. The fully tiled bathroom features a contemporary walk-in shower.\n\nLocated on Haddington Road in the heart of Dublin 4, this property offers an unbeatable location with easy access to all parts of the city. It is within walking distance of St. Stephen’s Green, the Grand Canal, DART stations, LUAS stops, and several bus routes, providing excellent transport connectivity.\n\nRefuse collection included",
